constraints:
1 <= N <= 10^{5}

expected time complexity: O(N)
expected auxiliary space: O(1)  (ie, you should not use the recursive stack space as well)

standard_solution_code:
class Solution:

	def isPalindrome(self, head):
		fast = head
		slow = head
		while fast and fast.next:
			fast = fast.next.next
			slow = slow.next
		prev = None
		while slow:
			temp = slow.next
			slow.next = prev
			prev = slow
			slow = temp
		(left, right) = (head, prev)
		while right:
			if left.data != right.data:
				return False
			left = left.next
			right = right.next
		return True
